                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14378893" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 24 Mar 2015 23:15:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexlevenson&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexlevenson&quot;&gt;alexlevenson&lt;/a&gt; is this a blocker for 1.6.0?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14379100" author="chinwei" created="Wed, 25 Mar 2015 01:21:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It also apply to PrimitiveType: INT32, OriginalType: INT_16&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14379216" author="alexlevenson" created="Wed, 25 Mar 2015 03:16:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rdblue&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rdblue&quot;&gt;rdblue&lt;/a&gt; we should probably fix it, it&apos;s an easy fix.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14390479" author="chinwei" created="Wed, 1 Apr 2015 12:28:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;When do we expect the fix to release?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14391029" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 1 Apr 2015 17:26:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexlevenson&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexlevenson&quot;&gt;alexlevenson&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;m going to make this a blocker for the 1.6.0 release since it is a simple fix. Would you mind fixing it? I don&apos;t really know my way through the filter code.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=chinwei&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;chinwei&quot;&gt;chinwei&lt;/a&gt;, if this makes the 1.6.0 release, then it will be released next week.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14482019" author="julienledem" created="Mon, 6 Apr 2015 21:43:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Is there a PR for this?&lt;br/&gt;
If not, I would suggest not making it a blocker for 1.6 as it does not look like a regression.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14482079" author="rdblue" created="Mon, 6 Apr 2015 22:21:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This isn&apos;t a regression because the filter2 API and INT_* types were introduced since 1.5.0. But it is a known bug with the new code and should be an easy fix. I don&apos;t mind not including this since it is so close to RC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14483476" author="rdblue" created="Tue, 7 Apr 2015 16:45:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m pushing this out of 1.6.0 to get the RC out today.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14484488" author="alexlevenson" created="Wed, 8 Apr 2015 01:12:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;sorry, I haven&apos;t had a chance to revisit this&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14518568" author="dragoncurve" created="Wed, 29 Apr 2015 02:05:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It seems to me like we shouldn&apos;t care so much what the original type is when checking the filter.  The only case in which I can understand that is for the UTF-8 strings etc., but for numeric values it doesn&apos;t make a lot of sense to me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14520655" author="alexlevenson" created="Thu, 30 Apr 2015 01:05:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes, this is probably overly strict. &lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;m trying to remember why I put this in there initially, but I agree it seems like we should let all the various kinds of numbers through. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14600137" author="alexlevenson" created="Wed, 24 Jun 2015 20:58:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 219&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/219&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/219&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857164" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1745&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1745&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
